---
import CheckoutLink from './CheckoutLink.astro';
import { starterGuideCheckoutUrl, starterGuidePricing } from '../data/starter-guide-offer';
const { location = 'learn-entry' } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="container sales-entry"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST PRODUCT STARTS WITH WHAT YOU KNOW</p><h2>Turn a useful idea<br/>into something you can sell.</h2><p>Don’t Do Anything walks through choosing a topic, creating a PDF, setting up checkout, and finding your first buyers. A concrete path from “I could make something” to a product people can buy.</p><ul class="value-checks"><li>98-page digital guide, with topic filters and planning templates</li><li>From the founder behind Strategic Sloth’s tools and studio</li><li>One-time purchase. Read and apply it at your own pace.</li></ul><div class="hero-actions"><CheckoutLink href={starterGuideCheckoutUrl} price={starterGuidePricing.currentPrice} product="starter-guide-5" location={location} label="Get the complete guide"/><a class="text-link" href="/samples/dont-do-anything/" data-track="cta_click" data-track-location={`${location}-sample`}>Read a real chapter →</a></div><p class="purchase-reassurance">Instant digital delivery · Secure Lemon Squeezy checkout · 30-day money-back guarantee</p></div>{location === 'starter-guide' ? <a class="starter-cover-stage" href="/samples/dont-do-anything/" aria-label="Read a sample of Don’t Do Anything"><span class="starter-cover-frame"><img src="/images/bookpdf.webp" alt="Don’t Do Anything — original illustrated Strategic Sloth book cover" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy"/></span></a> : <a class="sample-peek" href="/samples/dont-do-anything/" aria-label="Preview Finding Your Winning Topic"><img src="/samples/dont-do-anything-29.png" alt="An actual page from Finding Your Winning Topic, chapter five of Don’t Do Anything" width="827" height="1070" loading="lazy"/><span>INSIDE THE BOOK · CHAPTER 05 <b>Take a look ↗</b></span></a>}</section>
